# flip-typed-mid (H6): a value typed 300 ms into the flip's turn shows at
# once. The click flips a=2 to -2; 300 ms in the plane shows about -1.04;
# typing -1 into a's box (centre 331.5, 450.5, probed) and Enter shows
# a=-1.00 at once while the turn runs out. Behaviour: url line a=-1 after
# Enter; views shown line {a:-1, ...} at once.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query func=x2&a=2
wait 2000
click 218 450.5
wait 300
click 331.5 450.5
type "-1"
key Enter
wait 800
shot flip-typed-mid
